{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は全国握手会\n今日は個別握手会がありました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれたままで\n初披露だったから緊張した。\nカップリングの吐息のメソッドも\n実は歌ってます^^\nいちばん上手。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンケシェーン合いの手やったよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手は久しぶりに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/06/9621856/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優里と！楽しい♪\nいつもよりテンションが上がって\n握手してるかも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/06/9621856/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眼球見開きの写真\nメールでたくさん送ってるから\nしつこいかな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/06/9621856/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート mystic\nお母さんのシャツワンピinした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色が花粉ぽいから\nテーマは花粉です笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/06/9621856/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴下 ANTIPAST\nローファー three quarter"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部3部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/06/9621856/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャツワンピ as know as\nTシャツ UNIQLO\nショーパン PANAMABOY\n靴下 tutu anna"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/06/9621856/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部にリボンのピン留め3つ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/06/9621856/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部でも二つ結びにリボン。\nTシャツはスターウォーズが\nかわいいから買っちゃった〜\n実はDVD全巻持ってるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっべ写真はりすぎた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/04/06/9621856/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめましての方がたくさんで\n嬉しかったです。\nMVや特典映像の感想\nありがとうございました！\n乃木ここで流れたまりっか'17も\n好評？みたいで嬉しい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のネガティブなブログについて\n心配もしてくださって\nありがとうございました。\nほんと心強いです...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールも届いてるみたいでよかった、\n楽しんでくれてるみたいでよかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー楽しかった♪\n久しぶりに元気出たっっ\n明日からまた頑張ろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月3日のアンダーライブ\n応募締め切りが明日までです><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひともよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}